# Testing

- Prefer behavior-focused Pest tests over assertions on private structure.
- Do not delete or weaken an existing test. Add coverage for a behavior change.
- `tests/Arch/NamingArchitectureTest.php` stays green.
- No real network. Use the fake HTTP client and the recorded responses under `tests/Fixtures/Responses/`.
- The package floor is PHP ^8.2. Pest runs on PHP 8.3 and newer. There is no PHP 8.2 Pest job.
- Quality gate before a pull request: `composer lint`, `composer analyse`, and `composer test`.
- This package has no npm, Vitest, or `php artisan test` suite.
